.alert.alert-light.border
  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Goal of this page
  %p.mb-3 See who needs Goal Confidence attention so managers can keep scored goals freshly checked.

  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Context
  %p.mb-3
    Goal Confidence is a Gruuv Health category (Healthy / Warning / Needs Attention), same rules as 1:1 Hub Overview.
    Worst scored goal wins for the person. Drafts are not scored; completed goals stay in-scope for #{GoalsHealthHelper::COMPLETED_GOAL_WINDOW_DAYS} days.

  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Specifics of this page
  %h5.fw-semibold.mb-2 How to read each row
  %ul.mb-3
    %li Status icon is the person’s Goal Confidence rollup.
    %li Middle column counts Healthy / Warning / Needs Attention goals (Active | Completed; Drafts only on Needs Attention).
    %li Attachments list assignments, abilities, values, prompts, and child goals when present.
    %li Refresh queues a Gruuv Health recalculation when data looks stale.

  %h5.fw-semibold.mb-2 Status legend
  %ul.list-unstyled.mb-0
    %li.mb-1
      %span.d-inline-block.rounded-circle.me-2.bg-success{style: "width:0.65rem;height:0.65rem;"}
      Healthy — scored goals checked within #{GoalsHealthHelper::GOAL_CONFIDENCE_HEALTHY_DAYS} days
    %li.mb-1
      %span.d-inline-block.rounded-circle.me-2.bg-warning{style: "width:0.65rem;height:0.65rem;"}
      Warning — worst goal last checked #{GoalsHealthHelper::GOAL_CONFIDENCE_HEALTHY_DAYS + 1}–#{GoalsHealthHelper::GOAL_CONFIDENCE_NEEDS_ATTENTION_DAYS - 1} days ago
    %li.mb-0
      %span.d-inline-block.rounded-circle.me-2.bg-danger{style: "width:0.65rem;height:0.65rem;"}
      Needs Attention — ≥ #{GoalsHealthHelper::GOAL_CONFIDENCE_NEEDS_ATTENTION_DAYS} days, never checked, or no scored goals
